{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22853","headline":"寄蕲州簟与元九因题六韵 · 白居易","name":"寄蕲州簟与元九因题六韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"笛竹出蕲春，霜刀劈翠筠。\n织成双锁簟，寄与独眠人。\n卷作筒中信，舒爲席上珍。\n滑如铺薤叶，冷似卧龙鳞。\n清润宜乘露，鲜华不受尘。\n通州炎瘴地，此物最关身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22853.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22853","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}